{"about_the_game":"So, you just saw the banner and probably thought to yourself \u201cthis looks bad\u201d but wait! This is not what it looks like, it\u2019s much worse!<br>In this platformer, you try to climb a tower while your character cracks the worst jokes you\u2019ve ever heard.<br>You can\u2019t die, you just fall down. Yes. It\u2019s that kind of game. You die only on the inside. And that is mainly because of the terrible jokes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/5fb777cb126667d84f086e0825cff4d8.poster.avif?t=1689208973\" width=616 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/5fb777cb126667d84f086e0825cff4d8.webm?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/5fb777cb126667d84f086e0825cff4d8.mp4?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Don\u2019t hate it enough? There is also a dark level. (Could be worse, could be a dark + water level) (you\u2019re welcome.)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/456164f2ad36528201eaa020f69e1d41.poster.avif?t=1689208973\" width=714 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/456164f2ad36528201eaa020f69e1d41.webm?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/456164f2ad36528201eaa020f69e1d41.mp4?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But it\u2019s not all suffering, there are parts where you can have fun! YAY!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(Legal disclaimer: This single section only)</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/a0020ede81d51401c90e10320afde549.poster.avif?t=1689208973\" width=714 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/a0020ede81d51401c90e10320afde549.webm?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/a0020ede81d51401c90e10320afde549.mp4?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Don\u2019t worry too much there is a way to take out your anger sometimes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/3cb8f27e40b678ca933d62095a4402d6.poster.avif?t=1689208973\" width=616 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/3cb8f27e40b678ca933d62095a4402d6.webm?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/3cb8f27e40b678ca933d62095a4402d6.mp4?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You are not always the one laughing though.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/a9d9fc91b566007099a91194c7c2fb61.poster.avif?t=1689208973\" width=714 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/a9d9fc91b566007099a91194c7c2fb61.webm?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/a9d9fc91b566007099a91194c7c2fb61.mp4?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Every level usually has different paths to clear. But not to worry, we will take your hand so you never get lost, no matter your IQ!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/1fe7a2429d216932603503b2063d60ca.poster.avif?t=1689208973\" width=714 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/1fe7a2429d216932603503b2063d60ca.webm?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/1fe7a2429d216932603503b2063d60ca.mp4?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Come explore the secret of the elder elephant and get surprised for it!<br>(no money back please don\u2019t email us)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/1f3c5bb69668967b5fb9f772e26c2dbf.poster.avif?t=1689208973\" width=616 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/extras/1f3c5bb69668967b5fb9f772e26c2dbf.webm?t=1689208973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2115980?t=1689208973","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2115980?t=1689208973","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1689208973","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115980/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1689208973","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Shar